## Done so far (keep in mind)

- Guest JWT auth + refresh rotation; Dio 401 retry
- Curated bank (~12+/topic seeded) + OpenAI provider when `LLM_PROVIDER=openai`
- Custom topics: classify → generate → validate → session (cached by prompt key)
- Teach Me + question report (rate-limited)
- Scoring bugfix: do not stamp `served_at` early; honor taps (no false timeouts)
- Session no-repeat while unused bank items exist; sync fill when topic is thin
- Async bank top-up (`bank_topup` jobs), target 1000, chunk ~20, low watermark ~40
- Entitlements stub: free unlimited now; roadmap soft-cap ~30 + premium/diamonds (`ENTITLEMENTS_ENFORCE_QUESTION_CAPS`)
- Phase 5a: calendar daily streak; achievements on finish; `GET /achievements`
- Phase 5b: UTC daily challenge; Redis+Postgres leaderboards weekly/daily
- Phase 6a: Elo-lite `skill_ratings`; `adaptive=true` session start + casual mid-run nudges; `analytics_events` (postgres)

## Engineering invariants

1. Never put LLM on answer/play hot path.
2. Server is source of truth for score, entitlements, and question correctness.
3. Correct answers hidden until after submit; option order shuffled per serve.
4. Keys only in `.env` (gitignored); use `.env.example` for templates.
5. Prefer incremental, production-quality changes; keep stack runnable.

## Next work (Phase 6b)

StoreKit/Play Billing + entitlement enforcement, richer sharing, anti-cheat hardening.

